      "writtenOn": "2019-06-26T23:01:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "btw, what\u0027s the point of storing the hash instead of the value itself? It\u0027s still one to one mapping, the same size, no?\n\nMaybe hashing if necessary should be done by whoever retrieves this value?",
      "parentUuid": "a75e0a6f_90288445",
